        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Board agrees to provide each teacher regardless of age, with a term life insurance policy equal to the annual salary of each teacher or seven thousand five hundred dollars ($7,500), whichever is greater including accidental death and dismemberment coverage (extended contracts and supplements not included). Cost of this insurance will be paid by the Board.",
