            "block_content": "1. A teacher assigned to more than one (1) worksite shall have one (1) worksite assigned as his base school, and shall be reimbursed for all mileage excluding the round trip mileage from his home to his base school. Reimbursement shall be at the maximum rate allowed by Florida law.",
